1
00:00:03,231 --> 00:00:06,357
Open Interaction Center, Live dashboard.

2
00:00:06,357 --> 00:00:10,910
The status at the top says Connected while live updates work.

3
00:00:10,910 --> 00:00:14,511
The page refreshes by itself every ten seconds.

4
00:00:15,042 --> 00:00:20,172
The summary shows the total waiting across your queues, the available agents, the

5
00:00:20,172 --> 00:00:21,882
agents, and the queues.

6
00:00:22,437 --> 00:00:24,324
Each queue has a tile:

7
00:00:24,324 --> 00:00:32,138
waiting, signed-in agents, available, busy and not-ready agents, the longest wait, and service level breaches.

8
00:00:32,138 --> 00:00:37,325
A tile turns amber when the longest wait passes half the threshold, and

9
00:00:37,325 --> 00:00:38,807
red on a breach.

10
00:00:39,311 --> 00:00:43,942
When the dialer is on, a banner above the summary says what it is doing.

11
00:00:43,942 --> 00:00:48,750
The Why isn't this dialing panel explains why work is not being dispatched.

12
00:00:48,750 --> 00:00:50,591
Here, no work is waiting.

